  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "p.m.07:10 天候/晴天\nペンギン急便の拠点 荒れた室内"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "バイソン",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "ここがペンギン急便の拠点なんだ……。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "バイソン",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "（汚いな……しかも暗いよ。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "テキサス",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "ここは拠点の一つだ。あまり片づけてないが、まぁ、そこら辺に適当に座ってくれ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "バイソン",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "はい、ありが……そういえば、まだきちんとお礼の言葉を申し上げておりませんでした、ペンギン急便の皆様。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "テキサス",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "私は自分の仕事をしただけ。それよりキミは？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "バイソン",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "トランスポーターの、バイソンと申します。龍門フェンツ運輸より参りました。父の指示により、御社を見学させていただきます。どうぞご指導ご鞭撻のほどをよろしくお願い致します。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "バイソン",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "エンペラーさんとの契約内容に関しては既に確認しておりますが、まだ……。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エンペラー",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "ハッ、これは驚いたな。トンビが鷹を生むってやつか。あのガサツな親父がどうやってこんなデキた息子を——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "テキサス",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "……ボス。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エンペラー",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "おっと、これはすまねぇ。続けろ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "バイソン",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "はっ。先ほどの襲撃は、明らかにフェンツ運輸とペンギン急便への挑発です。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "バイソン",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "今回の件は軽視できません。必要ならば、ぼくが父と近衛局に連絡します。この事をテロだとみなすべきかと——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エンペラー",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "おい、テキサス。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "テキサス",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "なに？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エンペラー",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "晩飯はなんだい？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エクシア",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#8",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "もっちろん歓迎パーティー！　それしかないっしょ？　でもソラがいないかぁ。留守番頼んどいたハズだったんだけど？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クロワッサン",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd#3",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "テキサスはんが連絡すりゃあ、すぐにピューっと戻ってくるやろ。心配あらへんって。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クロワッサン",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "おっと堪忍な。話続けてや。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "バイソン",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "（ソラ？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "バイソン",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "……はい。当面の急務としては、ぼくたちを襲撃した敵の調査だと思います。ペンギン急便の皆さんは、何か手がかりになるようなことはありますでしょうか？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エクシア",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "ん～？　手がかり？　あんなのいつもの業務トラブルじゃない？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "バイソン",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "えっ、業務トラブル……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エンペラー",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "テキサス！　引き出しにあった俺の葉巻は！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エクシア",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#8",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "ボス、あたしたちがここに戻ってくるの久しぶりなんだし、そんなのとっくにカビ生えてるって。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "テキサス",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "ソラが掃除しにきたときに捨てたと思う。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エンペラー",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "カーッ、マジかよ。俺、今夜死ぬやつじゃん。これダメだろ。イヤ無理無理無理……。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エンペラー",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "あ、続けてくれ。気にすんな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "バイソン",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "まずぼくたちが明確にするべきなのは、敵の目的で——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エンペラー",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "ちょっと待て！　ミュージック！　俺のレコード！　ここに一箱置いといたはずだぜ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クロワッサン",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd#4",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "あぁ、それウチがここに運んできたやつやな。あの箱んなかエライもん入っとったなぁ。あんなんウチの月給の数ヶ月分や。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エクシア",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "ここにあるよ。何が聴きたい？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エンペラー",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "何でもいい。俺は宇宙の終焉まで残る芸術品しか選ばねぇよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エンペラー",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "やっぱ、音楽はイイぜ。コレがあるから人生楽しめるってもんだ。ビバ音楽！　ビバ俺ってな！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エンペラー",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "どうしたバイソン？　続けろよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "バイソン",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "……ぼく、何話してたんでしたっけ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エンペラー",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "襲撃した奴らの目的だろ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "バイソン",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "そうです！　彼らの目的はぼくでしょう。あるいは、御社と弊社の関係を揺さぶるためかと。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エンペラー",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "なんだよ。それだけかよ。てっきりこの前の仕返しだとばかり思ったぜ……。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "バイソン",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "何かお心当たりがあるのでしょうか？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エンペラー",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "——コホンッ！　おいテキサス！　奴らの調査に行ってこい！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "テキサス",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "残業代、三倍で。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エクシア",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "えーっ、こんな喧嘩なんて月に十七、八回ぐらいやってるっしょ。トランスポーターの仕事なんてこんなもんじゃないの？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "バイソン",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "……なぜそうお考えに？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "バイソン",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "トランスポーターには隠密かつ迅速な行動こそ求められるもので……武力を使うのは一般的ではないかと。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エクシア",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "そうなの？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "テキサス",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "……確かに私たちはただの運送会社のはず。なぜいつもマフィアの抗争に巻き込まれる？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エンペラー",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "簡単だ。奴らにはセンスがねぇ。人としてのセンスってやつがな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クロワッサン",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "せやせや、ウチらボスから貰うた給料分、ちゃーんとルールっちゅうもんを守って仕事してるで。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クロワッサン",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "たま～に、運送中にドンパチしとるだけや。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エクシア",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#8",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "だよね～。別に問題ないじゃん？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "バイソン",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "……？　これ本当に何も問題ないんですか？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "テキサス",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "まぁ……。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "テキサス",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "ちょっと待って。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "テキサス",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "ここ、ソラが残した暗号がある。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "バイソン",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "お、お菓子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エクシア",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "ああっ、もう、こんな開けっぱなしで置いてたら、湿気っちゃってマズくなっちゃうよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "テキサス",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "チョコレートの方をツーに、おしりのプレッツェルの方をトンに。これは暗号だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "バイソン",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "（個性的な暗号だな……。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クロワッサン",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd#2",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "なんなん？　あんときのを真に受けてるん？　冗談やろ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "テキサス",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "……私はただ普通にソラの話を覚えていただけだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "テキサス",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "「怪しい人物」か、ふむ……ソラは多分追って行ったのだろう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エンペラー",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "ソラは行かせてやれ。だが今日の俺たちは終業だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エンペラー",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "今日は安魂夜だ。残業も資本主義からの圧迫も無しにしようぜ。でないと安魂にならねぇだろ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エンペラー",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "で、誰か飲みに行きたいやつはいるか？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クロワッサン",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "おっ、コレはボスの奢りやねんな？　ええ具合いにたっかい秘蔵酒仕入れといたとこやったんや～！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エンペラー",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "あぁ、俺は構わないぜ。お前らのたけぇ給料からさっ引けばいいんだしな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クロワッサン",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd#5",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "なんでやねん！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "バイソン",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "ちょっと待ってください！　あの……ぼくたちは何か対策をしなくていいんでしょうか？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エンペラー",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "必要ねぇな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "バイソン",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "マフィアを野放しにする、と？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クロワッサン",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "ぼちぼち様子でも見といたらええんちゃう？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "バイソン",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "……龍門近衛局の介入はないんでしょうか？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エクシア",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "多分ないよね～。向こうだって慣れっこだし。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "バイソン",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "えぇ……。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "テキサス",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "慣れればなんてことはない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "テキサス",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "ただ、先月分の公共物の損害賠償リストは長かった。各自より注意するように。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "バイソン",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "……ところで、いつもはどんな仕事をされているのですか？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エクシア",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "もちろん荷物の配送と、あとは喧嘩だね。もし喧嘩になったら、喧嘩優先って感じかな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エクシア",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "ちなみに、依頼の元締めはボスだからね。でもどの仕事を担当するかは早い者勝ち！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "バイソン",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "……。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エンペラー",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "おい、バイソン。親父さんは俺にお前を託した。だから今からしばらくの間、お前はペンギン急便の一員ってわけだ。わかるか？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "バイソン",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "——はい……。多分、分かっている…と思います。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エンペラー",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "ならこれだけは覚えておけ。ペンギン急便の就労規則ってやつの第一条だ。それはな……「細かいコトは気にするな」だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エクシア",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "あれ？　昨日は「楽しみながら死んでいけ」じゃなかったっけ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クロワッサン",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd#4",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "ウチは「楽しみどきを逃すな」だった気ぃする。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エンペラー",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "……どれもあまり変わらねぇだろうが。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エンペラー",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "お前のような坊主を誘拐しようなんて犯罪、それこそこの龍門じゃ日常茶飯事だぜ。俺たちのルールはただ一つ。「やられたらやり返す」ただそれだけだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エンペラー",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "待て待て。なんか尻の下が変な感じするぞ。俺の人体工学に基づいたパーフェクトなソファーの下に何かねぇか？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エクシア",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ん？　ちょっと見てみようか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エクシア",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "あっ、可愛いアソート缶！　ボス、まさかソファーの下におやつ隠してたなんて！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エンペラー",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "なにを馬鹿な……どうして俺がそんなところに隠すんだよ——待てアソート缶だって？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エクシア",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "うん。アソートのグミ缶。「ヴィクトリア・フルーツグミ」って書いてあるし……。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "テキサス",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "離れてエクシア。それは恐らく罠。開けるな——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エクシア",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "はえ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "テキサス",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "みんな、伏せて！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
